    "updated_at": "2018-04-18T08:43:31Z",
    "body": "The idea is that it can't, I think.\r\n\r\nI guess the other idea we had here is that spec-level fetch would return something that would kinda be the observer thingy. Because having an instance of an algorithm doesn't make a whole lot of sense and we should probably not continue with that.",
